// Attributes are structs only (their `#[...]` arguments map to fields), so `@attribute` on an enum
// is a misplacement (E0054). Checked for a class but forgotten for an enum until the placement
// check became one loop over every directive and every declaration kind.
// expect: error E0054 at 7:6
// expect: exit 1
@attribute
enum Kind { A; B }
echo "unreached"
